name: ['Ainok Tracker', 'Altar of the Brood', 'Arashin War Beast', 'Arc Lightning', "Briber's Purse", 'Debilitating Injury', 'Dragonscale Boon', 'Fierce Invocation', 'Formless Nurturing', 'Ghostfire Blade', 'Grim Haruspex', 'Hewed Stone Retainers', 'Jeering Instigator', 'Jeskai Infiltrator', 'Mastery of the Unseen', 'Mystic of the Hidden Way', 'Reality Shift', 'Ruthless Ripper', 'Smite the Monstrous', 'Soul Summons', 'Sultai Emissary', "Ugin's Construct", 'Ugin, the Spirit Dragon', 'Watcher of the Roost', 'Wildcall', 'Write into Being']
