rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If a face-down Mystic of the Hidden Way is blocked and then turned face up, it stays blocked.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down spells or permanents you don\'t control unless an effect instructs you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': \'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield."}]', "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to that creature.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Jeering Instigator’s last ability can target any creature, even one that’s untapped or one you already control.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a converted mana cost of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn the face-down creature face up by revealing what its morph cost is and paying that cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to. Only a face-down permanent can be turned face up this way; a face-down spell cannot.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down spell or permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down spells or permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Morph lets you cast a card face down by paying {3}, and lets you turn the face-down permanent face up any time you have priority by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'The face-down spell has no mana cost and has a mana value of 0. When you cast a face-down spell, put it on the stack face down so no other player knows what it is, and pay {3}. This is an alternative cost.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'When the spell resolves, it enters the battlefield as a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the creature can still grant it any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for doing this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Activating the ability targeting a creature that’s already attacking or blocking won’t remove it from combat or affect that attack or block.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Briber’s Purse has no gem counters on it, it remains on the battlefield, although you can’t activate its last ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Dragonscale Boon can target any creature, including one that’s already untapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'Face-down creatures and most artifact creatures are colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If Altar of the Brood enters the battlefield under your control at the same time as other permanents, its ability will trigger for each of those permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'If some of the creatures are illegal targets as Arc Lightning tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies but no damage is dealt to the illegal targets. If all targets are illegal, Arc Lightning doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2014-09-20', 'text': 'You choose how many targets Arc Lightning has and how the damage is divided as you cast the spell. Each target must receive at least 1 damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it\'s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can\'t look at face-down permanents you don\'t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because face-down creatures don\'t have names, they can\'t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it\'s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn\'t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can\'t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It\'s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it\'s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won\'t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn\'t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it\'s a creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You\'re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on)."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A card’s owner is public information at all times. If the two cards you exile are owned by different players (perhaps because you gained control of a Jeskai Infiltrator owned by your opponent), which card is which is no longer hidden from your opponent. That player will know which face-down creature they own.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If Jeskai Infiltrator isn’t on the battlefield as its triggered ability resolves, you’ll manifest just the top card of your library.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you manifest a card owned by an opponent and you leave the game, that card is exiled.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The pile is shuffled to disguise from your opponents which manifested creature is which. After you manifest the cards, you can look at them.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect instructs you to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have a name, they can’t have the same name as any other creature or share any creature types with any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Aminatou’s second ability or Adarkar Valkyrie’s delayed triggered ability), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Some previous Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. Although a double-faced card can enter the battlefield face down, one already on the battlefield can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The face-down characteristics of a permanent are copiable values. If another object becomes a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of a face-down creature, that new object is a 2/2 colorless face-up creature with no abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'There are no cards in this set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using a morph ability, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Arashin War Beast’s ability will trigger only once per combat damage step, no matter how many creatures are blocking it.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a mana value of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you choose 0 for X, you’ll just manifest the top card of your library.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'A permanent that turns face up or face down changes characteristics but is otherwise the same permanent. Spells and abilities that were targeting that permanent, as well as Auras and Equipment that were attached to the permanent, aren’t affected.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Any time you have priority, you may turn a manifested creature face up by revealing that it’s a creature card (ignoring any copy effects or type-changing effects that might be applying to it) and paying its mana cost. This is a special action. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'At any time, you can look at a face-down permanent you control. You can’t look at face-down permanents you don’t control unless an effect allows you to or instructs you to.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because face-down creatures don’t have names, they can’t have the same name as any other creature, even another face-down creature.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Because the permanent is on the battlefield both before and after it’s turned face up, turning a permanent face up doesn’t cause any enters-the-battlefield abilities to trigger.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it. You must also reveal all face-down spells and permanents you control if you leave the game or if the game ends.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If a manifested creature would have morph if it were face up, you may also turn it face up by paying its morph cost.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Some older Magic sets feature double-faced cards, which have a Magic card face on each side rather than a Magic card face on one side and a Magic card back on the other. The rules for double-faced cards are changing slightly to account for the possibility that they are manifested. If a double-faced card is manifested, it will be put onto the battlefield face down. While face down, it can’t transform. If the front face of the card is a creature card, you can turn it face up by paying its mana cost. If you do, its front face will be up. A double-faced permanent on the battlefield still can’t be turned face down.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'The face-down permanent is a 2/2 creature with no name, mana cost, creature types, or abilities. It’s colorless and has a converted mana cost of 0. Other effects that apply to the permanent can still grant or change any of these characteristics.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'There are no cards in the Fate Reforged set that would turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, but some older cards can try to do this. If something tries to turn a face-down instant or sorcery card on the battlefield face up, reveal that card to show all players it’s an instant or sorcery card. The permanent remains on the battlefield face down. Abilities that trigger when a permanent turns face up won’t trigger, because even though you revealed the card, it never turned face up.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Turning a permanent face up or face down doesn’t change whether that permanent is tapped or untapped.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Unlike a face-down creature that was cast using the morph ability, a manifested creature may still be turned face up after it loses its abilities if it’s a creature card.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'You must ensure that your face-down spells and permanents can easily be differentiated from each other. You’re not allowed to mix up the cards that represent them on the battlefield in order to confuse other players. The order they entered the battlefield should remain clear. Common methods for indicating this include using markers or dice, or simply placing them in order on the battlefield. You must also track how each became face down (manifested, cast face down using the morph ability, and so on).'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If you choose to put permanent cards with morph onto the battlefield with the third ability, you must put them onto the battlefield face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Ugin, the Spirit Dragon is not a Dragon card; that is, he doesn\'t have the creature type Dragon. Spells and abilities that refer to Dragon cards or Dragons don\'t apply to Ugin."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The mana value of a token that isn\'t a copy of another object is 0. A token that is a copy of another object has the same mana cost as that object."}]', "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you control only colorless permanents as the ability resolves (for example, basic lands and face-down permanents), you won’t sacrifice anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'If you’re playing with the top card of your library revealed, you’ll manifest one of the cards, then the other one will be revealed, then you can choose to put that card on the bottom of your library or leave it on top.'}, {'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'Other players won’t know whether the card you manifest is the top card or second card of that library.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-11-24', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter whether the other spell resolved. It could have been countered or, if you’ve somehow cast Hewed Stone Retainers as though it had flash, it could still be on the stack.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Ainok-Spurensucher\', \'text\': \'ErstschlagMorph {4}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ainok sind wilde Köter, an unserem Feuer ist kein Platz für sie." —Surrak der Jagdrufer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394143&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249eb033-a01d-4861-9e17-6b85214b5a56\', \'multiverseId\': 394143}, \'multiverseid\': 394143}, {\'name\': \'Rastreador ainok\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.Metamorfosis {4}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador perro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los ainok no son más que perros salvajes. No son dignos de sentarse con nosotros en torno al fuego". —Surrak, la Voz de la caza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f38dc79-9a23-4c8d-a13f-ceb1512c7877\', \'multiverseId\': 394325}, \'multiverseid\': 394325}, {\'name\': \'Traqueur aïnok\', \'text\': \'InitiativeMue {4}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : chien de chasse et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "« Les aïnoks sont des chiens sauvages qui n\'ont pas leur place avec nous près du feu. » —Surrak, le Grand veneur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ef5d8e-11af-455e-8ccd-a684b09dc507\', \'multiverseId\': 394169}, \'multiverseid\': 394169}, {\'name\': \'Ainok Battipista\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvvisoMetamorfosi {4}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Segugio\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli ainok sono cani selvaggi, non meritano di unirsi a noi intorno al fuoco." —Surrak, il Convocatore di Caccia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44af8325-333a-40ce-813f-106d62389b3c\', \'multiverseId\': 394195}, \'multiverseid\': 394195}, {\'name\': \'アイノクの足跡追い\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃変異{4}{R}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猟犬・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'「アイノクは野犬だ。我らと共に火を囲むのに相応しい存在ではない。」 ――狩猟の統率者、スーラク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19ad768a-178a-4e01-bc7a-35f6e5ef7bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 394221}, \'multiverseid\': 394221}, {\'name\': \'아이녹 추적꾼\', \'text\': \'선제공격변이 {4}{B} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사냥개 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'"아이녹은 들개야. 우리와 함께 모닥불 가에 앉을 자격이 없다." —사냥 대장 서락\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2efa2938-eb50-4039-89f7-d935ff77a062\', \'multiverseId\': 394247}, \'multiverseid\': 394247}, {\'name\': \'Rastreador Ainok\', \'text\': \'IniciativaMetamorfose {4}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sabujo Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'"Os ainok são cães selvagens, não são dignos de unir-se a nós ao redor da fogueira." — Surrak, o Convocador da Caçada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e512255-3a98-42d5-a380-8ae784fd6c09\', \'multiverseId\': 394273}, \'multiverseid\': 394273}, {\'name\': \'Аинок-Следопыт\', \'text\': \'Первый ударОборотень {4}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пес Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'«Аиноки — это дикие собаки, которым не место у нашего костра». — Суррак, Созыватель Охоты\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'900b88bb-7d48-4a06-a868-ba2979cd2917\', \'multiverseId\': 394299}, \'multiverseid\': 394299}, {\'name\': \'侦猎犬人\', \'text\': \'先攻变身{4}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～猎犬／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「犬人就是野狗，不配跟我们一起围坐火旁。」 ～召猎人苏拉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0f2f78-e69c-47b1-ab84-ea1dfd65e2c4\', \'multiverseId\': 394091}, \'multiverseid\': 394091}, {\'name\': \'偵獵犬人\', \'text\': \'先攻變身{4}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～獵犬／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'「犬人就是野狗，不配跟我們一起圍坐火旁。」 ～召獵人蘇拉克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a887dc2-5369-49f2-a2a3-2ab6a29d0fee\', \'multiverseId\': 394117}, \'multiverseid\': 394117}]', '[{\'name\': \'Altar der Brut\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere bleibende Karte unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, legt jeder Gegner die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Bittsteller bringen Fleisch und Silber, Blumen und Blut. Der Altar nimmt sich, was er will, mit glühenden Augen voller Verheißung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394144&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6892b00c-c195-4151-87c3-489d02652798\', \'multiverseId\': 394144}, \'multiverseid\': 394144}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la progenie\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otro permanente entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los suplicantes ofrecen carne y plata, flores y sangre. El altar toma lo que desea y sus ojos brillan con promesas mudas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'858dc0c3-5f30-425a-b287-2a1c0b06f433\', \'multiverseId\': 394326}, \'multiverseid\': 394326}, {\'name\': \'Autel de la Couvée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un autre permanent arrive le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les quémandeurs déposent de la chair et de l\'argent, des fleurs et du sang. L\'autel prend ce qui lui convient, les yeux luisants de promesses inexprimées.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60caa61d-7d03-4adc-bf43-1cc7d95ce72e\', \'multiverseId\': 394170}, \'multiverseid\': 394170}, {\'name\': \'Altare della Nidiata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un altro permanente entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario mette nel proprio cimitero la prima carta del proprio grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "I supplici offrono carne e argento, fiori e sangue. L\'altare accetta ciò che predilige, i suoi occhi splendenti di promesse silenziose.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2035fb73-f2c4-46c9-9862-1d35106bfd7e\', \'multiverseId\': 394196}, \'multiverseid\': 394196}, {\'name\': \'群の祭壇\', \'text\': \'他のパーマネントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'嘆願者は肉や銀や花や血を奉納する。祭壇は望むものを取り、その目は語られざる約束で輝きを放っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'604d2f71-954b-4acf-9078-10dc4bdd1eec\', \'multiverseId\': 394222}, \'multiverseid\': 394222}, {\'name\': \'군락의 제단\', \'text\': \'당신의 조종하에 다른 지속물이 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'집행자는 살점과 은, 꽃, 피를 바친다. 제단은 말없이 약속하는 눈빛을 발하며 원하는 제물을 취한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70bf963e-766e-4cd4-9c96-7e96c4aeaa75\', \'multiverseId\': 394248}, \'multiverseid\': 394248}, {\'name\': \'Altar da Linhagem\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que outra permanente entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, cada oponente coloca o card do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os suplicantes oferecem carne e prata, flores e sangue. O altar recebe o que quer, seus olhos brilhando com promessas veladas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'414b5d5c-90d0-4282-91cd-38f02cf4116b\', \'multiverseId\': 394274}, \'multiverseid\': 394274}, {\'name\': \'Алтарь Выводка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другой перманент выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Просители приносят плоть и серебро, цветы и кровь. Алтарь принимает то, что ему угодно, и его глаза сияют невысказанными обещаниями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70b33c11-d4bf-445a-836b-6482a87ab644\', \'multiverseId\': 394300}, \'multiverseid\': 394300}, {\'name\': \'族群祭坛\', \'text\': \'每当另一个永久物在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各将其牌库顶牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'祈求者献上鲜肉与白银、鲜花和血液。祭坛取走它想要的，眼睛闪烁着不成文的诺言。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f625f993-aedb-4384-a69b-c582cd2e54e4\', \'multiverseId\': 394092}, \'multiverseid\': 394092}, {\'name\': \'族群祭壇\', \'text\': \'每當另一個永久物在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各將其牌庫頂牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'祈求者獻上鮮肉與白銀、鮮花和血液。祭壇取走它想要的，眼睛閃爍著不成文的諾言。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e82ad4f7-ef7f-4ff3-a1ea-d7e28f0f46be\', \'multiverseId\': 394118}, \'multiverseid\': 394118}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arashin-Kriegsbestie\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Arashin-Kriegsbestie einer oder mehreren blockenden Kreaturen Kampfschaden zufügt, manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394145&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1140a449-d640-4050-ab75-abe827f04548\', \'multiverseId\': 394145}, \'multiverseid\': 394145}, {\'name\': \'Bestia de guerra de Arashin\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Bestia de guerra de Arashin haga daño de combate a una o más criaturas bloqueadoras, manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f44afcc3-6477-48fa-925f-b9b94ff7f177\', \'multiverseId\': 394327}, \'multiverseid\': 394327}, {\'name\': "Bête de guerre d\'Arashin", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Bête de guerre d\'Arashin inflige des blessures de combat à au moins une créature bloqueuse, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3065cb71-fc34-4e3e-b67b-b736a1709f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 394171}, \'multiverseid\': 394171}, {\'name\': \'Bestia da Guerra di Arashin\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la Bestia da Guerra di Arashin infligge danno da combattimento a una o più creature bloccanti, manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'826e371d-69b8-4a51-bcdf-de037ae93c02\', \'multiverseId\': 394197}, \'multiverseid\': 394197}, {\'name\': \'アラシンの軍獣\', \'text\': \'アラシンの軍獣が１体以上のブロック・クリーチャーに戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示する。（それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee26dbf-fb0e-41a0-8391-d279134aad23\', \'multiverseId\': 394223}, \'multiverseid\': 394223}, {\'name\': \'아라신 전쟁 야수\', \'text\': \'아라신 전쟁 야수가 하나 이상의 방어생물에 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한다. (해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5162d9-5a06-480e-8dfe-6b787b8ef6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 394249}, \'multiverseid\': 394249}, {\'name\': \'Fera de Guerra Arashin\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Fera de Guerra Arashin causa dano de combate a uma ou mais criaturas bloqueadoras, manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório. (Coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e614beb6-40f3-4b10-8389-7f3d6c40b575\', \'multiverseId\': 394275}, \'multiverseid\': 394275}, {\'name\': \'Арашинский Боевой Зверь\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Арашинский Боевой Зверь наносит боевые повреждения одному или нескольким блокирующим существам, воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. (Положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d2dc994-cd41-4ce2-84a6-075d1689adb9\', \'multiverseId\': 394301}, \'multiverseid\': 394301}, {\'name\': \'阿拉辛战争兽\', \'text\': \'每当阿拉辛战争兽对一个或数个进行阻挡的生物造成战斗伤害时，显化你的牌库顶牌。（将它面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06020c22-2feb-4fdc-be11-85a8ec89aa94\', \'multiverseId\': 394093}, \'multiverseid\': 394093}, {\'name\': \'阿拉辛戰爭獸\', \'text\': \'每當阿拉辛戰爭獸對一個或數個進行阻擋的生物造成戰鬥傷害時，顯化你的牌庫頂牌。（將它面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65f2a2b4-f825-43cf-bba4-8cfddc9e5195\', \'multiverseId\': 394119}, \'multiverseid\': 394119}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beherrschung des Unsichtbaren\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine bleibende Karte, die du kontrollierst, aufgedeckt wird, erhältst du für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.{3}{W}: Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394157&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22821445-97b8-4b7f-b344-32aea7c86c50\', \'multiverseId\': 394157}, \'multiverseid\': 394157}, {\'name\': \'Maestría de lo oculto\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un permanente que controlas se ponga boca arriba, ganas 1 vida por cada criatura que controlas.{3}{W}: Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79c20a3-cee7-4c0e-aa7d-b51dce65a85c\', \'multiverseId\': 394339}, \'multiverseid\': 394339}, {\'name\': "Maîtrise de l\'inapparence", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un permanent que vous contrôlez est retourné face visible, vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.{3}{W} : Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0aca02-0576-44c9-8eb1-ad33bf21441d\', \'multiverseId\': 394183}, \'multiverseid\': 394183}, {\'name\': "Dominio dell\'Invisibile", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un permanente che controlli viene girato a faccia in su, guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura che controlli.{3}{W}: Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b8b1206-983f-4001-979d-7d4f9f9d087e\', \'multiverseId\': 394209}, \'multiverseid\': 394209}, {\'name\': \'見えざるものの熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするパーマネントが１つ表向きになるたび、あなたはあなたがコントロールするクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。{3}{W}：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示する。（それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b337807f-1e3d-47db-b65a-b1f4ef47ce23\', \'multiverseId\': 394235}, \'multiverseid\': 394235}, {\'name\': \'숨겨진 자들의 비술\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 지속물이 앞면 상태로 뒤집힐 때마다, 당신은 당신이 조종하는 각 생물당 생명 1점을 얻는다.{3}{W}: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한다. (해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8244799-12bb-4b2e-bbd1-f44ea0063bd1\', \'multiverseId\': 394261}, \'multiverseid\': 394261}, {\'name\': \'Domínio do Invisível\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma permanente sob seu controle é voltada para cima, você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura que você controla.{3}{W}: Manifeste o card do topo de seu grimório. (Coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72acb7a6-1155-40ca-b95c-1296440d2178\', \'multiverseId\': 394287}, \'multiverseid\': 394287}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Невидимых\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда перманент под вашим контролем переворачивается рубашкой вниз, вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое существо под вашим контролем.{3}{W}: воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. (Положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46f84d0-4c93-45dc-a119-4797450f52e9\', \'multiverseId\': 394313}, \'multiverseid\': 394313}, {\'name\': \'消形奇技\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的永久物翻回正面时，你每操控一个生物，便获得1点生命。{3}{W}：显化你的牌库顶牌。（将它面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c2e64d8-9c8e-47f0-a439-29e9705fbd60\', \'multiverseId\': 394105}, \'multiverseid\': 394105}, {\'name\': \'消形奇技\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的永久物翻回正面時，你每操控一個生物，便獲得1點生命。{3}{W}：顯化你的牌庫頂牌。（將它面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daeb7746-16cb-4d0a-b9b9-87da29724e87\', \'multiverseId\': 394131}, \'multiverseid\': 394131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Monster erschlagen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Veränderung eines einzigen Augenblicks in Tarkirs Vergangenheit führte zu einer alternativen Zukunft und schrieb so den Lauf der Geschichte neu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394161&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b5b974-1dd4-4c2f-9c6f-f4dd1c999aae\', \'multiverseId\': 394161}, \'multiverseid\': 394161}, {\'name\': \'Abatir al monstruo\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El cambio de un solo instante en el pasado de Tarkir alteró su futuro y reescribió la historia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541a57b2-e55e-44f9-b4f8-c874047cb6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 394343}, \'multiverseid\': 394343}, {\'name\': \'Pourfendre le monstrueux\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec une force supérieure ou égale à 4 ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Il a suffi d\'altérer un seul instant du passé de Tarkir pour modifier son futur et réécrire son histoire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71e8c0fa-33ac-4359-9173-49339ed0e554\', \'multiverseId\': 394187}, \'multiverseid\': 394187}, {\'name\': \'Punire i Mostruosi\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il cambiamento di un singolo attimo nel passato di Tarkir ha alterato il suo futuro, riscrivendone la storia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f60029-edb6-4fd1-8986-7e6f8d96e23b\', \'multiverseId\': 394213}, \'multiverseid\': 394213}, {\'name\': \'大物潰し\', \'text\': \'パワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'タルキールの過去における一瞬の変更はその未来をも変更し、タルキールの歴史は書き換えられた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76ef5a38-6d75-4d5b-acb8-b94cae96bd5b\', \'multiverseId\': 394239}, \'multiverseid\': 394239}, {\'name\': \'괴물의 격파\', \'text\': \'공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'타르커의 과거에서 일순간이 바뀌자 타르커의 미래가 변해 역사가 새로 쓰여졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf62dbf7-501f-4a10-9d6e-d21882cf7e69\', \'multiverseId\': 394265}, \'multiverseid\': 394265}, {\'name\': \'Golpear o Monstruoso\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com poder igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A mudança de um único momento do passado de Tarkir alterou seu futuro, reescrevendo sua história.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2b7cd49-c3c4-4a56-b00d-6b179d0a1a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 394291}, \'multiverseid\': 394291}, {\'name\': \'Сразить Чудовище\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с силой 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Изменение лишь одного момента в прошлом Таркира поменяло его будущее, переписав всю историю.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'557a4815-7442-483d-8b7e-e27fc75d3bc6\', \'multiverseId\': 394317}, \'multiverseid\': 394317}, {\'name\': \'击灭恶物\', \'text\': \'消灭目标力量等于或大于4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'鞑契过往这一瞬的变化已经改变未来，重写历史。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dbbdba0-d956-4eba-bce4-b290f1f51fad\', \'multiverseId\': 394109}, \'multiverseid\': 394109}, {\'name\': \'擊滅惡物\', \'text\': \'消滅目標力量等於或大於4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'韃契過往這一瞬的變化已經改變未來，重寫歷史。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8eae6b5-2bb8-4092-9bb4-5722d0b93fbf\', \'multiverseId\': 394135}, \'multiverseid\': 394135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geisterfeuerklinge\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2.Ausrüsten {3}Die Ausrüsten-Fähigkeit der Geisterfeuerklinge kostet beim Aktivieren {2} weniger, falls sie eine farblose Kreatur als Ziel hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du das Feuer des Drachen fürchtest, bist du unwürdig, es zu führen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394152&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ca06cb-a70f-4801-89f2-a3acc07c8843\', \'multiverseId\': 394152}, \'multiverseid\': 394152}, {\'name\': \'Espada de fuego fantasmal\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2.Equipar {3}.Cuesta {2} menos activar la habilidad de equipar de la Espada de fuego fantasmal si hace objetivo a una criatura incolora.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Si temes el fuego del dragón, no eres digno de empuñarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19969b27-8cee-4227-b011-3c899fd7f2fa\', \'multiverseId\': 394334}, \'multiverseid\': 394334}, {\'name\': "Lame d\'ectofeu", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+2.Équipement {3}La capacité d\'équipement de la Lame d\'ectofeu coûte {2} de moins à activer si elle cible une créature incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Si vous craignez la flamme du dragon, vous n\'êtes pas digne de la manier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c5f0b0-3b2a-4395-9f7d-7cbc8d332bf6\', \'multiverseId\': 394178}, \'multiverseid\': 394178}, {\'name\': \'Lama di Fuoco Spettrale\', \'text\': "La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2.Equipaggiare {3}L\'abilità equipaggiare della Lama di Fuoco Spettrale costa {2} in meno per essere attivata se bersaglia una creatura incolore.", \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Se temi il fuoco del drago, non sei degno di impugnarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d407e09-2ed0-492f-b8ab-f36b002166be\', \'multiverseId\': 394204}, \'multiverseid\': 394204}, {\'name\': \'幽霊火の刃\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。装備{3}それが無色のクリーチャーを対象としたなら、幽霊火の刃の装備能力を起動するためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'龍の炎を恐れるのであれば、あなたにそれを振るう資格はありません。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aae7c39-348b-4b04-9377-05fa3860b819\', \'multiverseId\': 394230}, \'multiverseid\': 394230}, {\'name\': \'유령불꽃 검\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+2를 받는다.장착 {3}유령불꽃 검의 장착 능력은 무색 생물을 목표로 정한다면 활성화하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'용의 불꽃을 두려워하는 자는 그것을 손에 쥘 자격이 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26a9167e-5e3f-4268-b40e-05dc940e0abb\', \'multiverseId\': 394256}, \'multiverseid\': 394256}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Lumespectro\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+2.Equipar {3}A habilidade de equipar de Lâmina de Lumespectro custa {2} a menos para ser ativada se o alvo for uma criatura incolor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Se você teme o fogo do dragão, não é digno de empunhá-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fba24f2-e1c4-4e3f-b08b-6ade07acb6c3\', \'multiverseId\': 394282}, \'multiverseid\': 394282}, {\'name\': \'Клинок Призрачного Пламени\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+2.Снарядить {3}Активация способности «Снарядить» Клинка Призрачного Пламени стоит на {2} меньше, если ее целью является бесцветное существо.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Если ты боишься драконьего огня, то недостоин носить его.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cabd8b1-57ad-49e2-9d01-3526c3e5d168\', \'multiverseId\': 394308}, \'multiverseid\': 394308}, {\'name\': \'灵火剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2。佩带{3}如果灵火剑之佩带异能的目标是无色生物，则该异能减少{2}来起动。\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'如果你怕龙火，那么你便没资格挥舞它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23ec6ce5-2359-486f-b5f6-cb5bda53ca83\', \'multiverseId\': 394100}, \'multiverseid\': 394100}, {\'name\': \'靈火劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+2。佩帶{3}如果靈火劍之佩帶異能的目標是無色生物，則該異能減少{2}來起動。\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'如果你怕龍火，那麼你便沒資格揮舞它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'812d450d-cc00-460e-ab21-5490acf4bfb1\', \'multiverseId\': 394126}, \'multiverseid\': 394126}]', "[{'name': 'Geldbeutel des Bestechers', 'text': 'Der Geldbeutel des Bestechers kommt mit X Edelsteinmarken ins Spiel.{1}, {T}, entferne eine Edelsteinmarke vom Geldbeutel des Bestechers: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht angreifen oder blocken.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Je größer die Hand, desto höher der Preis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394147&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6fa066b0-05cd-4b46-9a00-8f9f651b8f33', 'multiverseId': 394147}, 'multiverseid': 394147}, {'name': 'Bolsa del sobornador', 'text': 'La Bolsa del sobornador entra al campo de batalla con X contadores de gema sobre ella.{1}, {T}, remover un contador de gema de la Bolsa del sobornador: La criatura objetivo no puede atacar ni bloquear este turno.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Cuanto más grande la mano, mayor es el precio.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394329&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '36bf0e59-faad-4884-89ae-fb308aad8855', 'multiverseId': 394329}, 'multiverseid': 394329}, {'name': 'Bourse du corrupteur', 'text': 'La Bourse du corrupteur arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs « gemme » sur elle.{1}, {T}, retirez un marqueur « gemme » de la Bourse du corrupteur : La créature ciblée ne peut ni attaquer, ni bloquer ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Plus la main est grande, plus le prix est élevé.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394173&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3218c46-c242-45be-aacc-d9e610cdddaa', 'multiverseId': 394173}, 'multiverseid': 394173}, {'name': 'Borsa del Corruttore', 'text': 'La Borsa del Corruttore entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini gemma.{1}, {T}, Rimuovi un segnalino gemma dalla Borsa del Corruttore: Una creatura bersaglio non può attaccare o bloccare in questo turno.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': 'Più grande è la mano, più alto è il prezzo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394199&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e89112aa-607b-417e-9ccd-50b412617dd2', 'multiverseId': 394199}, 'multiverseid': 394199}, {'name': '贈賄者の財布', 'text': '贈賄者の財布は、宝石カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。{1}, {T}, 贈賄者の財布の上から宝石カウンターを１個取り除く：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはこのターン、攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '手が大きいほど、その対価は高くなる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394225&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '43859f3a-cc44-4db7-9bd8-333620a5b4a9', 'multiverseId': 394225}, 'multiverseid': 394225}, {'name': '뇌물 주머니', 'text': '뇌물 주머니는 보석 카운터 X개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.{1}, {T}, 뇌물 주머니에서 보석 카운터 한 개를 제거한다: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.', 'type': '마법물체', 'flavor': '손이 크면 클수록 대가도 비싸지기 마련이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394251&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff35706a-2405-4a0c-b545-fd7cdceb2d3f', 'multiverseId': 394251}, 'multiverseid': 394251}, {'name': 'Bolsa do Subornador', 'text': 'Bolsa do Subornador entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores de gema.{1}, {T}, Remova um marcador de gema de Bolsa do Subornador: A criatura alvo não pode atacar nem bloquear neste turno.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': 'Quanto maior a mão, mais alto é o preço.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394277&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71d82311-adf9-48e0-a6d6-009164720574', 'multiverseId': 394277}, 'multiverseid': 394277}, {'name': 'Кошель со Взяткой', 'text': 'Кошель со Взяткой выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами самоцвета на нем.{1}, {T}, удалите один жетон самоцвета с Кошеля со Взяткой: целевое существо не может атаковать или блокировать в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': 'Чем шире лапа, тем выше цена.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394303&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f20dc093-adce-4bf8-94f8-8134207fb96a', 'multiverseId': 394303}, 'multiverseid': 394303}, {'name': '行贿者钱包', 'text': '行贿者钱包进战场时上面有X个宝石指示物。{1}，{T}，从行贿者钱包上移去一个宝石指示物：目标生物本回合不能进行攻击或阻挡。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '手越大，价越高。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394095&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2999220d-f7f4-4c1a-8d67-d7477daeabc0', 'multiverseId': 394095}, 'multiverseid': 394095}, {'name': '行賄者錢包', 'text': '行賄者錢包進戰場時上面有X個寶石指示物。{1}，{T}，從行賄者錢包上移去一個寶石指示物：目標生物本回合不能進行攻擊或阻擋。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '手越大，價越高。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394121&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60972bbc-2b1a-4995-993e-9158e627e103', 'multiverseId': 394121}, 'multiverseid': 394121}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gesandter der Sultai\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gesandte der Sultai stirbt, manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe diese Karte als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Für die Sultai war Ugins Magie nur eine weitere Ressource, die es auszubeuten galt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394163&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e2530cd-920d-4f49-9dfb-8ddec6ae35f6\', \'multiverseId\': 394163}, \'multiverseid\': 394163}, {\'name\': \'Emisario sultai\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Emisario sultai muera, manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Para los Sultai, el poder de Ugin solo era un recurso más que explotar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79a4bdf7-6fc4-4400-9ffb-bbcbbb3815ac\', \'multiverseId\': 394345}, \'multiverseid\': 394345}, {\'name\': \'Émissaire de Sultaï\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Émissaire de Sultaï meurt, manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Pour les Sultaï, le pouvoir d\'Ugin n\'était qu\'une ressource de plus à exploiter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc6ed5e-a83d-428c-93a8-fdc81bf6b320\', \'multiverseId\': 394189}, \'multiverseid\': 394189}, {\'name\': \'Emissario Sultai\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Emissario Sultai muore, manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Per i Sultai, il potere di Ugin era solo un\'altra risorsa da sfruttare.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cac0eb4a-3468-4d30-bc85-012d1245de2f\', \'multiverseId\': 394215}, \'multiverseid\': 394215}, {\'name\': \'スゥルタイの使者\', \'text\': \'スゥルタイの使者が死亡したとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示する。（そのカードを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'スゥルタイにとって、ウギンの力は搾取するべき資源のひとつでしかなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66cd6d45-6b47-47de-b124-f547e34435c8\', \'multiverseId\': 394241}, \'multiverseid\': 394241}, {\'name\': \'술타이 사절\', \'text\': \'술타이 사절이 죽을 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한다. (해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 전사\', \'flavor\': \'술타이 부족에게 우진의 힘은 유용한 자원일 뿐이었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14fbc3ac-a203-4e39-9611-0d98af13f53c\', \'multiverseId\': 394267}, \'multiverseid\': 394267}, {\'name\': \'Emissário Sultai\', \'text\': \'Quando Emissário Sultai morrer, manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório. (Coloque o card no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Para os Sultai, o poder de Ugin era só mais um recurso a ser explorado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a2f153-11af-40e1-b474-014814fcdaa4\', \'multiverseId\': 394293}, \'multiverseid\': 394293}, {\'name\': \'Султайский Посланник\', \'text\': \'Когда Султайский Посланник умирает, воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. (Положите ту карту на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Для султайцев могущество Уджина было лишь еще одним ресурсом, которым можно воспользоваться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ba2d897-198a-424c-80d8-736fb6d4fc6e\', \'multiverseId\': 394319}, \'multiverseid\': 394319}, {\'name\': \'苏勒台密使\', \'text\': \'当苏勒台密使死去时，显化你的牌库顶牌。（将该牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～灵俑／战士\', \'flavor\': \'在苏勒台眼中，乌金的力量不过是另一种尚待利用的资源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f6a5586-08ab-4233-af58-e2119dc688c6\', \'multiverseId\': 394111}, \'multiverseid\': 394111}, {\'name\': \'蘇勒台密使\', \'text\': \'當蘇勒台密使死去時，顯化你的牌庫頂牌。（將該牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～殭屍／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'在蘇勒台眼中，烏金的力量不過是另一種尚待利用的資源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38ed38a2-df84-4c6a-a93d-a1a50930224f\', \'multiverseId\': 394137}, \'multiverseid\': 394137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gestaltlose Aufzucht\', \'text\': \'Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394151&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'305977ce-1f1a-4933-b940-5dfb3a1929cf\', \'multiverseId\': 394151}, \'multiverseid\': 394151}, {\'name\': \'Pábulo informe\', \'text\': \'Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2977e5e7-af9f-44a3-900f-fce001b4df56\', \'multiverseId\': 394333}, \'multiverseid\': 394333}, {\'name\': \'Nourrissage sans forme\', \'text\': "Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eca3be30-0da6-4111-80c2-d216f2ee16a9\', \'multiverseId\': 394177}, \'multiverseid\': 394177}, {\'name\': \'Nutrimento Amorfo\', \'text\': \'Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fb3ec27-3ca0-4291-be42-a2914fc418a5\', \'multiverseId\': 394203}, \'multiverseid\': 394203}, {\'name\': \'無形の育成\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示し、その後、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。（カードを予示するには、それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15066b5d-4d8c-429c-9891-8b791fb5f06b\', \'multiverseId\': 394229}, \'multiverseid\': 394229}, {\'name\': \'무형의 보살핌\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한 다음, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. (카드를 구현화하려면 해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec4fb74-38c8-4624-864f-f003db655af0\', \'multiverseId\': 394255}, \'multiverseid\': 394255}, {\'name\': \'Nutrição Desforme\', \'text\': \'Manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório e coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f829e8-d961-4e4c-bd9a-76910026400c\', \'multiverseId\': 394281}, \'multiverseid\': 394281}, {\'name\': \'Бесформенное Взращивание\', \'text\': \'Воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки, затем положите на нее один жетон +1/+1. (Чтобы воплотить карту, положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082c3d12-c16a-4cb8-a8aa-5a3845581e64\', \'multiverseId\': 394307}, \'multiverseid\': 394307}, {\'name\': \'无形滋养\', \'text\': \'显化你的牌库顶牌，然后在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。（显化某张牌的流程是，将该牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c274d888-fc7b-4c32-878a-15640eb93364\', \'multiverseId\': 394099}, \'multiverseid\': 394099}, {\'name\': \'無形滋養\', \'text\': \'顯化你的牌庫頂牌，然後在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。（顯化某張牌的流程是，將該牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d47803-c77c-4bac-bcec-480809dd977a\', \'multiverseId\': 394125}, \'multiverseid\': 394125}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmige Haruspex\', \'text\': \'Morph {B} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, die du kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Eure Feinde mögen nicht viel Köpfchen haben, aber an Eingeweiden mangelt es ihnen nicht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394153&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c64e5356-b585-4f72-9880-8b3074914263\', \'multiverseId\': 394153}, \'multiverseid\': 394153}, {\'name\': \'Arúspice siniestra\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)Siempre que otra criatura que controlas que no sea ficha muera, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede que sus enemigos sean cobardes, mi señor, pero no se puede decir que no tengan sangre en las venas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf8b2d6-eaba-45c0-ae44-1b248eb77ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 394335}, \'multiverseid\': 394335}, {\'name\': \'Aruspice sinistre\', \'text\': "Mue {B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton que vous contrôlez meurt, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Vos ennemis sont peut-être couards, mon seigneur, mais on ne peut pas dire qu\'ils n\'ont rien dans le ventre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394179&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0fe803f-5caf-40e8-999e-6136c4e57b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 394179}, \'multiverseid\': 394179}, {\'name\': \'Aruspice Macabra\', \'text\': "Metamorfosi {B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina che controlli muore, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"I vostri nemici potranno essere codardi, mio signore, ma di certo non manca loro il fegato."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1161f416-9d5b-48d4-bcd8-04693c29ce60\', \'multiverseId\': 394205}, \'multiverseid\': 394205}, {\'name\': \'不気味な腸卜師\', \'text\': \'変異{B}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）あなたがコントロールする他のトークンでないクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「閣下、敵はたしかに腰抜けどもかもしれません。しかし彼らを腑抜けと呼ぶのは如何なものかと。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65d5aede-5a88-4fbb-bb3e-f8e2383a5b53\', \'multiverseId\': 394231}, \'multiverseid\': 394231}, {\'name\': \'끔찍한 창자 점쟁이\', \'text\': \'변이 {B} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)당신이 조종하는 다른 토큰이 아닌 생물이 죽을 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"폐하, 적이 겁쟁이처럼 보일 순 있지만, 그렇다고 쓸개 빠진 놈이라 하시는 건 절대 안 됩니다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d46f2f61-2bd7-4fb4-b32d-6f878fc0bee1\', \'multiverseId\': 394257}, \'multiverseid\': 394257}, {\'name\': \'Arúspice Sinistra\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose {B} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)Toda vez que outra criatura que não seja ficha sob seu controle morrer, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Seus inimigos podem ser covardes, meu senhor, mas ninguém pode dizer que não tenham estômago."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b83fd7aa-1327-41b9-a011-4d715366362a\', \'multiverseId\': 394283}, \'multiverseid\': 394283}, {\'name\': \'Безжалостная Гадательница\', \'text\': \'Оборотень {B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)Каждый раз, когда другое не являющееся фишкой существо под вашим контролем умирает, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Ваши враги могут быть трусливы, господин, но нельзя сказать, что у них кишка тонка».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567071bb-e309-4ab9-bcc2-2b12aeea575a\', \'multiverseId\': 394309}, \'multiverseid\': 394309}, {\'name\': \'阴森肠占师\', \'text\': \'变身{B}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）每当另一个由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「主上，您的敌人或许胆小，但绝不能说他们无胆。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83116580-27c3-40f5-aa09-4628808c8d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 394101}, \'multiverseid\': 394101}, {\'name\': \'陰森腸占師\', \'text\': \'變身{B}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）每當另一個由你操控且非衍生物的生物死去時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「主上，您的敵人或許膽小，但絕不能說他們無膽。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6eccea-8f73-4bae-bab0-154a69dfb809\', \'multiverseId\': 394127}, \'multiverseid\': 394127}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gunst der Drachenschuppe\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und enttappe sie.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nur jene, die sich als würdig erwiesen haben, dürfen eine Drachenschuppe tragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394149&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03c80080-68c0-4ba9-8c18-5e2c222b56ba\', \'multiverseId\': 394149}, \'multiverseid\': 394149}, {\'name\': \'Bendición escamadragón\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo y enderézala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Solo aquellos que han demostrado ser dignos pueden recibir escamas de dragón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e760a03-1a30-4275-b8fa-c6c06229eed5\', \'multiverseId\': 394331}, \'multiverseid\': 394331}, {\'name\': "Faveur d\'écailledragon", \'text\': \'Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée et dégagez-la.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Seuls ceux qui s\'en montrent dignes reçoivent une écaille de dragon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d21a109-96fe-4b40-a34b-1854acfcb01e\', \'multiverseId\': 394175}, \'multiverseid\': 394175}, {\'name\': \'Dono della Scaglia di Drago\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio e STAPpala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Solo a chi dimostra il proprio valore viene conferita una scaglia di drago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b15fe3-3608-4e2e-8ac8-58b1f1d5a984\', \'multiverseId\': 394201}, \'multiverseid\': 394201}, {\'name\': \'龍鱗の加護\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置き、それをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'龍鱗が与えられるのは、それを纏う資格を自ら証明した者たちだけである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d605e00d-7a0d-4e91-84b1-bae3310de05a\', \'multiverseId\': 394227}, \'multiverseid\': 394227}, {\'name\': \'용비늘의 은혜\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓은 후 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'자신의 가치를 증명한 전사만 용 비늘을 가질 자격이 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eed2c8a-ffc8-4b22-8ea9-4ca84f61eba4\', \'multiverseId\': 394253}, \'multiverseid\': 394253}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva da Escama do Dragão\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 sobre a criatura alvo e desvire-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Somente aqueles que se provaram dignos recebem as escamas do dragão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dd12612-6247-49d5-9490-b3b1a292d296\', \'multiverseId\': 394279}, \'multiverseid\': 394279}, {\'name\': \'Дар Драконьей Чешуи\', \'text\': \'Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо и разверните его.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Драконью чешую получают лишь те, кто доказал, что они этого достойны.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9b99d7-a4ff-445c-9a1a-2672757fb9cd\', \'multiverseId\': 394305}, \'multiverseid\': 394305}, {\'name\': \'龙鳞恩泽\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物并重置它。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'唯有证明自身价值者才配得赐龙鳞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c4d0dbc-e7a4-4b07-b2a6-4a274e6942c1\', \'multiverseId\': 394097}, \'multiverseid\': 394097}, {\'name\': \'龍鱗恩澤\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物並重置它。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'唯有證明自身價值者才配得賜龍鱗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab15c0d-083a-4f17-8840-47b3eb2ab6fb\', \'multiverseId\': 394123}, \'multiverseid\': 394123}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinderliche Verletzung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine KreaturDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Jedes Wesen kennt Schwäche, nur die Drachen nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394148&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0a8da1-6575-4771-aaea-e71022cce528\', \'multiverseId\': 394148}, \'multiverseid\': 394148}, {\'name\': \'Herida debilitadora\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.La criatura encantada obtiene -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La debilidad anida en todos los que no son dragones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53756d7-9e97-4f7e-a4a7-714413c49fab\', \'multiverseId\': 394330}, \'multiverseid\': 394330}, {\'name\': \'Blessure incapacitante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créatureLa créature enchantée gagne -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "La faiblesse afflige quiconque n\'est pas un dragon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a44bff-134f-426f-8975-9c8ca56d699c\', \'multiverseId\': 394174}, \'multiverseid\': 394174}, {\'name\': \'Ferita Debilitante\', \'text\': \'Incanta creaturaLa creatura incantata prende -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La debolezza è insita in tutti coloro che non sono draghi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1596b843-875e-4503-a27b-f08930706280\', \'multiverseId\': 394200}, \'multiverseid\': 394200}, {\'name\': \'消耗する負傷\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）エンチャントされているクリーチャーは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'龍ならざる者のすべての内には、弱点が存在する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3624b4a9-8082-4f04-ba1c-d59a699be6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 394226}, \'multiverseid\': 394226}, {\'name\': \'쇠약해지는 부상\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여부여된 생물은 -2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'용이 아닌 모든 존재에는 나약함이 깃들어 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7955428-4ed9-4c44-8633-a1cb0526d8b1\', \'multiverseId\': 394252}, \'multiverseid\': 394252}, {\'name\': \'Ferimento Debilitante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criaturaA criatura encantada recebe -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Fraquezas existem em todos os que não são dragões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250cd81a-0f4f-4f13-88a7-8df122d7feb1\', \'multiverseId\': 394278}, \'multiverseid\': 394278}, {\'name\': \'Ослабляющая Рана\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существоЗачарованное существо получает -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Слабость присуща всем, кто не родился драконом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8364d112-d46b-4e71-80cc-520a6511a698\', \'multiverseId\': 394304}, \'multiverseid\': 394304}, {\'name\': \'虚弱创伤\', \'text\': \'结附于生物所结附的生物得-2/-2。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'若非巨龙，必有弱点。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283acacf-6400-4788-a4e6-917e56b055c3\', \'multiverseId\': 394096}, \'multiverseid\': 394096}, {\'name\': \'虛弱創傷\', \'text\': \'結附於生物所結附的生物得-2/-2。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'若非巨龍，必有弱點。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b9218e6-d264-48fd-8353-9e907aaba225\', \'multiverseId\': 394122}, \'multiverseid\': 394122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ins Leben rufen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Manifestiere eine dieser beiden Karten und lege dann die andere auf oder unter deine Bibliothek. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394168&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2731a2b8-fce2-49f4-a96e-9c07f54f6d74\', \'multiverseId\': 394168}, \'multiverseid\': 394168}, {\'name\': \'Escribir el ser\', \'text\': \'Mira las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Manifiesta una de esas cartas, luego pon la otra en la parte superior o en el fondo de tu biblioteca. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46b3f0c2-e1e4-4fb0-b159-82577946a6be\', \'multiverseId\': 394350}, \'multiverseid\': 394350}, {\'name\': "Consigner à l\'existence", \'text\': "Regardez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Manifestez une de ces cartes, puis mettez l\'autre au-dessus ou au-dessous de votre bibliothèque. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'564a6767-bc3c-4140-9679-9b4bab508932\', \'multiverseId\': 394194}, \'multiverseid\': 394194}, {\'name\': \'Origine dalla Scrittura\', \'text\': "Guarda le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Manifesta una di quelle carte, poi metti l\'altra in cima o in fondo al tuo grimorio. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12ea4c2b-f66a-4b41-ba41-353944799316\', \'multiverseId\': 394220}, \'multiverseid\': 394220}, {\'name\': \'実在への書き込み\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを見る。そのうちの１枚を予示し、もう１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上か一番下に置く。（カードを予示するには、それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4732c2b8-db30-4168-a068-fba986806473\', \'multiverseId\': 394246}, \'multiverseid\': 394246}, {\'name\': \'존재로 새겨지다\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 본다. 그 중 한 장을 구현화한 다음 나머지 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 위 또는 맨 밑에 놓는다. (카드를 구현화하려면 해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e92ea1b-a6e5-4b22-a386-009f7004a296\', \'multiverseId\': 394272}, \'multiverseid\': 394272}, {\'name\': \'Escrever Existência\', \'text\': \'Olhe os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Manifeste um desses cards. Depois, coloque o outro no topo ou no fundo do seu grimório. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79356674-c2d5-4f5d-b287-fe849fd9bb92\', \'multiverseId\': 394298}, \'multiverseid\': 394298}, {\'name\': \'Сделать Явью\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Воплотите одну из тех карт, затем положите вторую на верх или в низ вашей библиотеки. (Чтобы воплотить карту, положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c25fdebd-5005-48b6-ade7-b3ee64888380\', \'multiverseId\': 394324}, \'multiverseid\': 394324}, {\'name\': \'墨写成真\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的两张牌。显化其中一张牌，然后将另一张置于你的牌库顶或牌库底。（显化某张牌的流程是，将该牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24059fa4-ebc4-49dc-bf4d-b16e16954b0a\', \'multiverseId\': 394116}, \'multiverseid\': 394116}, {\'name\': \'墨寫成真\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的兩張牌。顯化其中一張牌，然後將另一張置於你的牌庫頂或牌庫底。（顯化某張牌的流程是，將該牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8d61f4b-d8a2-4632-b5e0-c8a4c213d635\', \'multiverseId\': 394142}, \'multiverseid\': 394142}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jeskai-Infiltratorin\', \'text\': \'Die Jeskai-Infiltratorin kann nicht geblockt werden, solange du keine anderen Kreaturen kontrollierst.Wenn die Jeskai-Infiltratorin einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke sie und die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek zusammen verdeckt ins Exil, mische sie und manifestiere dann diese Karten. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394156&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b08392b-8d1b-4fbf-905a-260faf34dee8\', \'multiverseId\': 394156}, \'multiverseid\': 394156}, {\'name\': \'Espía jeskai\', \'text\': \'La Espía jeskai no puede ser bloqueada mientras no controles ninguna otra criatura.Cuando la Espía jeskai haga daño de combate a un jugador, exíliala junto con la primera carta de tu biblioteca en una pila boca abajo, baraja esa pila y luego manifiesta esas cartas. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7806d280-722e-41b6-b0db-8e1fa2882442\', \'multiverseId\': 394338}, \'multiverseid\': 394338}, {\'name\': \'Infiltratrice jeskaï\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltratrice jeskaï ne peut pas être bloquée tant que vous ne contrôlez pas d\'autre créature.Quand l\'Infiltratrice jeskaï inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez-la ainsi que la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans un tas face cachée, mélangez-le, puis manifestez ces cartes. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c142418b-6c50-465f-bc89-b7341ed73d53\', \'multiverseId\': 394182}, \'multiverseid\': 394182}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrata Jeskai\', \'text\': "L\'Infiltrata Jeskai non può essere bloccata fintanto che non controlli altre creature.Quando l\'Infiltrata Jeskai infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esiliala con la prima carta del tuo grimorio in una pila a faccia in giù, rimescola quella pila, poi manifesta quelle carte. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad8354e2-9576-4274-b46a-5378d3000e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 394208}, \'multiverseid\': 394208}, {\'name\': \'ジェスカイの浸透者\', \'text\': \'あなたが他にクリーチャーをコントロールしていないかぎり、ジェスカイの浸透者はブロックされない。ジェスカイの浸透者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えたとき、これとあなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを裏向きのカードの束に追放し、その束を切り直して、その後それらのカードを予示する。（カードを予示するには、それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7545eac-7198-4c24-ae63-2d72cddfc779\', \'multiverseId\': 394234}, \'multiverseid\': 394234}, {\'name\': \'제스카이 침투원\', \'text\': \'당신이 다른 생물을 조종하지 않는 한, 제스카이 침투원은 방어될 수 없다.제스카이 침투원이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때, 제스카이 침투원과 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 추방하고 뒷면이 보이도록 쌓고 섞은 다음 그 카드들을 구현화한다. (카드를 구현화하려면 해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 승려\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'572b0d5a-fcce-4b44-97e4-946e2ebb9078\', \'multiverseId\': 394260}, \'multiverseid\': 394260}, {\'name\': \'Infiltradora Jeskai\', \'text\': \'Infiltradora Jeskai não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto você não controlar outras criaturas.Quando Infiltradora Jeskai causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile-a junto com o card do topo de seu grimório em um monte voltado para baixo, embaralhe o monte e manifeste os dois cards. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb2a8aa-dcdf-48be-9ac6-352a3ef6f000\', \'multiverseId\': 394286}, \'multiverseid\': 394286}, {\'name\': \'Джескайский Шпион\', \'text\': \'Джескайский Шпион не может быть заблокирован, пока под вашим контролем нет других существ.Когда Джескайский Шпион наносит боевые повреждения игроку, изгоните его и верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки в стопку карт рубашкой вверх, перетасуйте ту стопку, затем воплотите те карты. (Чтобы воплотить карту, положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Монах\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcb7fa8-0341-4705-85e9-16bad88e8437\', \'multiverseId\': 394312}, \'multiverseid\': 394312}, {\'name\': \'洁斯凯渗透者\', \'text\': \'只要你未操控其他生物，洁斯凯渗透者便不能被阻挡。当洁斯凯渗透者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐它和你的牌库顶牌并牌面朝下地放作一堆，将此牌堆洗牌，然后显化这些牌。（显化某张牌的流程是，将该牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394104&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68350891-fcb8-4adf-b484-669d143398ee\', \'multiverseId\': 394104}, \'multiverseid\': 394104}, {\'name\': \'潔斯凱滲透者\', \'text\': \'只要你未操控其他生物，潔斯凱滲透者便不能被阻擋。當潔斯凱滲透者對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，放逐它和你的牌庫頂牌並牌面朝下地放作一堆，將此牌堆洗牌，然後顯化這些牌。（顯化某張牌的流程是，將該牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／修行僧\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ade090d-47e7-4359-8a37-e03252472e55\', \'multiverseId\': 394130}, \'multiverseid\': 394130}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lichtbogen\', \'text\': \'Der Lichtbogen fügt 3 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf ein, zwei oder drei Ziele deiner Wahl, die Kreaturen und/oder Spieler sein können, du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Licht leuchtet dem Drachen den Weg.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394146&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888171fb-5101-47e0-8667-458d6badcf76\', \'multiverseId\': 394146}, \'multiverseid\': 394146}, {\'name\': \'Relámpago arco\', \'text\': \'El Relámpago arco hace 3 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre una, dos o tres criaturas y/o jugadores objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El relámpago abrasa el camino del dragón.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d1f23a-dbb5-4ce6-abe6-129ff74f4505\', \'multiverseId\': 394328}, \'multiverseid\': 394328}, {\'name\': \'Arc électrique\', \'text\': "L\'Arc électrique inflige 3 blessures réparties de la manière que vous choisissez entre une, deux ou trois cibles, créatures et/ou joueurs.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'éclair ouvre la voie au dragon.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d185fe14-6827-48b3-8192-84c41c307a44\', \'multiverseId\': 394172}, \'multiverseid\': 394172}, {\'name\': \'Fulmine ad Arco\', \'text\': \'Il Fulmine ad Arco infligge 3 danni divisi a tua scelta tra una, due o tre creature e/o giocatori bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il fulmine incenerisce qualsiasi ostacolo lungo il cammino del drago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d061bc83-57ce-46d5-97e3-58182514f743\', \'multiverseId\': 394198}, \'multiverseid\': 394198}, {\'name\': \'弧状の稲妻\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやプレイヤーを、１つか２つか３つ対象とする。弧状の稲妻は、それらに３点のダメージをあなたの好きなように分割して与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'龍の道を稲妻が焼き払う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f54555f2-e776-439b-b30b-49fb030c0552\', \'multiverseId\': 394224}, \'multiverseid\': 394224}, {\'name\': \'아크 방전\', \'text\': \'플레이어 및/또는 생물을 최대 세 개까지 목표로 정한다. 아크 방전은 그 목표들에 피해 3점을 당신이 나눈 대로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'용이 지나간 자리는 번개로 시커멓게 그을린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029b8480-668a-48a6-b980-bbe4ba02875e\', \'multiverseId\': 394250}, \'multiverseid\': 394250}, {\'name\': \'Raio Voltaico\', \'text\': \'Raio Voltaico causa 3 pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre uma, duas ou três criaturas e/ou jogadores alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Raios calcinam o caminho do dragão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c2858c-b7df-4cbb-af64-c6e551f27792\', \'multiverseId\': 394276}, \'multiverseid\': 394276}, {\'name\': \'Дуговая Молния\', \'text\': \'Дуговая Молния наносит 3 повреждения, разделенные по вашему выбору между одним, двумя или тремя целевыми существами и (или) игроками.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Молния прожигает дорогу дракону.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d23cbb3d-e2ad-4b63-a1d1-65bcd1cf586c\', \'multiverseId\': 394302}, \'multiverseid\': 394302}, {\'name\': \'弧状闪电\', \'text\': \'弧状闪电对一个，两个，或三个目标生物和／或牌手造成共3点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'闪电烧出巨龙的通路。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5698a73a-5d88-4004-b779-5701d4cce7e2\', \'multiverseId\': 394094}, \'multiverseid\': 394094}, {\'name\': \'弧狀閃電\', \'text\': \'弧狀閃電對一個，兩個，或三個目標生物和／或玩家造成共3點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'閃電燒出巨龍的道路。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd411076-17fb-4ef4-82cd-9510211896d6\', \'multiverseId\': 394120}, \'multiverseid\': 394120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mystiker des Verborgenen Weges\', \'text\': \'Der Mystiker des Verborgenen Weges kann nicht geblockt werden.Morph {2}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt viele unterschiedliche Wege. Der Große Lehrmeister weist sie uns alle."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394158&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4965c18f-4266-4628-be19-721b7ed49f64\', \'multiverseId\': 394158}, \'multiverseid\': 394158}, {\'name\': \'Místico de la sabiduría oculta\', \'text\': \'El Místico de la sabiduría oculta no puede ser bloqueado.Metamorfosis {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Existen muchos caminos. El Gran Maestro los revela todos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a35f91-f73d-487e-b8f0-a570f506e04a\', \'multiverseId\': 394340}, \'multiverseid\': 394340}, {\'name\': \'Mystique de la Voie secrète\', \'text\': \'Le Mystique de la Voie secrète ne peut pas être bloqué.Mue {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et moine\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y a bien des voies différentes. Le Grand précepteur les révèle toutes. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30f917c6-d715-4ad0-8f09-18eb1335d623\', \'multiverseId\': 394184}, \'multiverseid\': 394184}, {\'name\': \'Mistico della Via Nascosta\', \'text\': \'Il Mistico della Via Nascosta non può essere bloccato.Metamorfosi {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Esistono molti cammini differenti. Il Gran Maestro rivela ognuno di essi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeed5a9f-919b-4526-abec-767b32097fce\', \'multiverseId\': 394210}, \'multiverseid\': 394210}, {\'name\': \'隠道の神秘家\', \'text\': \'隠道の神秘家はブロックされない。変異{2}{U}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「進める道は無数にある。偉大な師は、それらをすべて明かしてくれる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53da036f-5608-4db9-8d2f-34b5086e66ea\', \'multiverseId\': 394236}, \'multiverseid\': 394236}, {\'name\': \'숨겨진 길의 신비주의자\', \'text\': \'숨겨진 길의 신비주의자는 방어될 수 없다.변이 {2}{U} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 승려\', \'flavor\': \'"길은 수없이 많다. 위대한 스승은 그 길을 모두 알려준다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab54408d-b69a-454e-a729-735a75b4212c\', \'multiverseId\': 394262}, \'multiverseid\': 394262}, {\'name\': \'Místico do Caminho Oculto\', \'text\': \'Místico do Caminho Oculto não pode ser bloqueado.Metamorfose {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Monge\', \'flavor\': \'"Há muitos caminhos diferentes. O Grande Mestre revela todos eles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ac9ef25-903c-4675-b762-5bb299f33928\', \'multiverseId\': 394288}, \'multiverseid\': 394288}, {\'name\': \'Мистик Тайного Пути\', \'text\': \'Мистик Тайного Пути не может быть заблокирован.Оборотень {2}{U} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Монах\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть множество разных путей. Великий Наставник показывает все».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e91fa736-0b06-43c2-9792-b846742b633f\', \'multiverseId\': 394314}, \'multiverseid\': 394314}, {\'name\': \'隐宗秘教徒\', \'text\': \'隐宗秘教徒不能被阻挡。变身{2}{U}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「世间道路众多，唯有大宗师能揭示一切。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bace8a4-f642-4b61-b378-88c0cf3a0951\', \'multiverseId\': 394106}, \'multiverseid\': 394106}, {\'name\': \'隱宗秘教徒\', \'text\': \'隱宗秘教徒不能被阻擋。變身{2}{U}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「世間道路眾多，唯有大宗師能揭示一切。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c4b39f-1bae-4b2a-abe4-eacd68e48d16\', \'multiverseId\': 394132}, \'multiverseid\': 394132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Realitätsverschiebung\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher manifestiert die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek. (Dazu bringt dieser Spieler die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist, kann sie jederzeit für ihre Manakosten aufgedeckt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394159&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6e6c767-97d9-410b-acb2-9dd8820e4e3b\', \'multiverseId\': 394159}, \'multiverseid\': 394159}, {\'name\': \'Cambio de realidad\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador manifiesta la primera carta de su biblioteca. (Ese jugador pone la primera carta de su biblioteca en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Si es una carta de criatura, puede ponerse boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e05ee76f-cfa0-48cf-a69c-dc36fccc31f1\', \'multiverseId\': 394341}, \'multiverseid\': 394341}, {\'name\': \'Bouleversement de réalité\', \'text\': "Exilez la créature ciblée. Son contrôleur manifeste la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. (Ce joueur met la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Si c\'est une carte de créature, elle peut être retournée face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b6a722-13d2-4a5b-aed5-c678147d6e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 394185}, \'multiverseid\': 394185}, {\'name\': \'Mutamento della Realtà\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore manifesta la prima carta del suo grimorio. (Quel giocatore mette la prima carta del suo grimorio sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, può essere girata a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c3c218-fbe4-40ef-82a9-d86fe82b45d5\', \'multiverseId\': 394211}, \'multiverseid\': 394211}, {\'name\': \'現実変容\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを追放する。それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示する。（そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e4dc50d-e666-4cf4-8ca5-ad5538cb36ff\', \'multiverseId\': 394237}, \'multiverseid\': 394237}, {\'name\': \'현실 조작\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 추방한다. 그 생물의 조종자는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한다. (그 플레이어는 해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49626600-19b5-4d40-af97-da22a5b6bc32\', \'multiverseId\': 394263}, \'multiverseid\': 394263}, {\'name\': \'Desvio de Realidade\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Seu controlador manifesta o card do topo do grimório dele. (Aquele jogador coloca o card do topo do grimório dele no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Se for um card de criatura, ele pode ser voltado para cima a qualquer momento pelo custo de mana dele.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fc0850-a9b2-49b5-8a61-926a2ab3c06f\', \'multiverseId\': 394289}, \'multiverseid\': 394289}, {\'name\': \'Сдвиг Реальности\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо. Контролирующий его игрок воплощает верхнюю карту своей библиотеки. (Тот игрок кладет верхнюю карту своей библиотеки на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, ее в любой момент можно перевернуть рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06ecde7c-cb9d-4d81-a8be-d7c09e16a9a8\', \'multiverseId\': 394315}, \'multiverseid\': 394315}, {\'name\': \'实界变化\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。其操控者显化其牌库顶牌。（该牌手将其牌库顶牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。若该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用来翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e42567-f21c-46ee-b8ba-6bf518adbe59\', \'multiverseId\': 394107}, \'multiverseid\': 394107}, {\'name\': \'實界變化\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。其操控者顯化其牌庫頂牌。（該玩家將其牌庫頂牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。若該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用來翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e2c6e39-20dd-479d-9917-db869f33a6da\', \'multiverseId\': 394133}, \'multiverseid\': 394133}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seelenbeschwörung\', \'text\': \'Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ugins Magie wirkt über die Drachen hinaus. Die Klane haben sie für den Krieg adaptiert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394162&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e202bd78-677f-4658-ac54-d2d7a2ebc399\', \'multiverseId\': 394162}, \'multiverseid\': 394162}, {\'name\': \'Invocaciones de alma\', \'text\': \'Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La magia de Ugin va más allá de los dragones. Los clanes la han adaptado para la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f01fe1-b294-4b23-b148-3428e470744b\', \'multiverseId\': 394344}, \'multiverseid\': 394344}, {\'name\': "Recrutement d\'âme", \'text\': "Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La magie d\'Ugin n\'est pas destinée qu\'aux dragons. Les clans l\'ont adaptée pour la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22388172-550d-4fe3-927d-a04e96442b6e\', \'multiverseId\': 394188}, \'multiverseid\': 394188}, {\'name\': \'Evocazioni Spirituali\', \'text\': \'Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio. (Mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "La magia di Ugin non si ferma ai draghi. I clan l\'hanno adattata per la guerra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42590c91-4950-4cc9-9579-3314aa214395\', \'multiverseId\': 394214}, \'multiverseid\': 394214}, {\'name\': \'魂の召喚\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示する。（それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンの魔法は龍族を越えて広まっていった。氏族たちはそれを戦のために改良していった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477b14a1-49af-4b85-af2f-e67105938b31\', \'multiverseId\': 394240}, \'multiverseid\': 394240}, {\'name\': \'영혼 소환\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한다. (해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'우진의 마법은 용에게만 영향을 주는 것이 아니다. 부족들은 전투에서 우진의 마법을 사용한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3eb0a20-0315-41a1-8bf3-43b9c71836fe\', \'multiverseId\': 394266}, \'multiverseid\': 394266}, {\'name\': \'Evocação das Almas\', \'text\': \'Manifeste o card do topo de seu grimório. (Coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A magia de Ugin vai além dos dragões. Os clãs a adaptaram para a guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3457adc5-3eba-4f77-bc07-3121a11f400b\', \'multiverseId\': 394292}, \'multiverseid\': 394292}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Души\', \'text\': \'Воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. (Положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Магия Уджина подвластна не одним лишь драконам. Кланы приспособили ее для ведения войны.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3001544-7bdf-449a-95a6-ff053e9df543\', \'multiverseId\': 394318}, \'multiverseid\': 394318}, {\'name\': \'唤魂术\', \'text\': \'显化你的牌库顶牌。（将它面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'乌金的魔法已不再为龙专属，各部落已将其活用于战事之中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea07bd7-6e42-4da9-9bc8-dcec7a7ae1ac\', \'multiverseId\': 394110}, \'multiverseid\': 394110}, {\'name\': \'喚魂術\', \'text\': \'顯化你的牌庫頂牌。（將它面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'烏金的魔法已不再為龍專屬，各部落已將其活用於戰事之中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6d93925-750b-4a32-a5b9-d7fdc6acdbc9\', \'multiverseId\': 394136}, \'multiverseid\': 394136}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spottender Aufhetzer\', \'text\': \'Morph {2}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)Wenn der Spottende Aufhetzer aufgedeckt wird und falls es dein Zug ist, übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl. Enttappe diese Kreatur. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394155&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19dd03e0-1b14-46fe-be1c-cc10696fd056\', \'multiverseId\': 394155}, \'multiverseid\': 394155}, {\'name\': \'Instigador de la mofa\', \'text\': \'Metamorfosis {2}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)Cuando el Instigador de la mofa se ponga boca arriba, si es tu turno, gana el control de otra criatura objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f26edc7d-d6fe-4f89-a7b7-1969c187fa9f\', \'multiverseId\': 394337}, \'multiverseid\': 394337}, {\'name\': \'Instigateur de moqueries\', \'text\': "Mue {2}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)Quand l\'Instigateur de moqueries est retourné face visible, si c\'est votre tour, acquérez le contrôle d\'une autre créature ciblée jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbd91c0-557d-48f6-9951-4ca8d591343f\', \'multiverseId\': 394181}, \'multiverseid\': 394181}, {\'name\': \'Istigatore Sbeffeggiante\', \'text\': "Metamorfosi {2}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)Quando l\'Istigatore Sbeffeggiante viene girato a faccia in su, se è il tuo turno, prendi il controllo di un\'altra creatura bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quella creatura. Ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ae5fb64-541d-48fc-9c4b-218c5c9fd0bc\', \'multiverseId\': 394207}, \'multiverseid\': 394207}, {\'name\': \'嘲る扇動者\', \'text\': \'変異{2}{R}（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）嘲る扇動者が表向きになったとき、あなたのターンである場合、他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b60205-88fa-440c-ad77-e08025b33a6a\', \'multiverseId\': 394233}, \'multiverseid\': 394233}, {\'name\': \'야유하는 선동가\', \'text\': \'변이 {2}{R} (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)야유하는 선동가가 앞면으로 뒤집히면, 당신의 턴이라면, 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 턴종료까지 그 생물의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 생물은 언탭되며 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00b66f29-d047-4545-8240-3690753c7c43\', \'multiverseId\': 394259}, \'multiverseid\': 394259}, {\'name\': \'Instigador Zombeteiro\', \'text\': \'Metamorfose {2}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)Quando Instigador Zombeteiro é voltado para cima, se for seu turno, ganhe o controle de outra criatura alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquela criatura. Ela ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d272308b-e2a6-4633-bd54-8fd0ad3e80e3\', \'multiverseId\': 394285}, \'multiverseid\': 394285}, {\'name\': \'Язвительный Подстрекатель\', \'text\': \'Оборотень {2}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)Когда Язвительный Подстрекатель переворачивается рубашкой вниз, если идет ваш ход, получите контроль над другим целевым существом до конца хода. Разверните то существо. Оно получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b5ac32-60a1-4d10-ac32-e4c34e01c098\', \'multiverseId\': 394311}, \'multiverseid\': 394311}, {\'name\': \'嘲讽煽动者\', \'text\': \'变身{2}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）当嘲讽煽动者翻回正面时，若是在你的回合中，则获得另一个目标生物的操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37ad1338-237e-4294-841a-b40619db7438\', \'multiverseId\': 394103}, \'multiverseid\': 394103}, {\'name\': \'嘲諷煽動者\', \'text\': \'變身{2}{R}（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）當嘲諷煽動者翻回正面時，若是在你的回合中，則獲得另一個目標生物的操控權直到回合結束。重置該生物。它獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6af4d2-fc9b-44c1-b6cb-362a8d52d7c8\', \'multiverseId\': 394129}, \'multiverseid\': 394129}]', '[{\'name\': \'Steinerne Gefolgsmänner\', \'text\': \'Wirke die Steinernen Gefolgsmänner nur, falls du in diesem Zug bereits einen anderen Zauberspruch gewirkt hast.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihre Herkunft ist in Mysterien gehüllt. Ich glaube, dass sie die Hüter der verlorenen Geheimnisse unserer Welt sind." —Jilaya, Flüsterin der Temur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394154&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2606087-b75b-4f63-99b7-00cf7ef56685\', \'multiverseId\': 394154}, \'multiverseid\': 394154}, {\'name\': \'Servidores de piedra tallada\', \'text\': \'Lanza los Servidores de piedra tallada solo si lanzaste otro hechizo este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'"Sus orígenes están envueltos en misterio. Creo que protegen los secretos perdidos de nuestro mundo". —Yilaya, susurradora temur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c72acd5b-6b63-47f4-8872-f1c6117a0c6c\', \'multiverseId\': 394336}, \'multiverseid\': 394336}, {\'name\': \'Serviteurs de pierre taillée\', \'text\': \'Ne lancez les Serviteurs de pierre taillée que si vous avez lancé un autre sort ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "« Leurs origines sont enveloppées de mystère. Je crois qu\'ils sont les protecteurs des secrets oubliés de notre monde. » —Jilaya, chuchoteuse temurienne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a88baa-4e4e-4368-a419-cbaa4a093dc7\', \'multiverseId\': 394180}, \'multiverseid\': 394180}, {\'name\': \'Seguaci Scolpiti nella Pietra\', \'text\': "Lancia i Seguaci Scolpiti nella Pietra solo se hai lanciato un\'altra magia in questo turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"Le loro origini sono avvolte nel mistero. Credo siano i protettori dei segreti perduti del nostro mondo." —Jilaya, sussurratrice Temur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'656e8a92-9000-489a-a214-b87152ea538a\', \'multiverseId\': 394206}, \'multiverseid\': 394206}, {\'name\': \'切り出した石の従者\', \'text\': \'切り出した石の従者は、このターンにあなたが他の呪文を唱えていたときにのみ唱えられる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'「それらの起源は謎に包まれています。恐らく、我々の世界の失われた秘密の守護者なのでしょう。」 ――ティムールの囁く者、ジレイヤ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44785ff3-e073-4e27-a224-0ee50fc86b74\', \'multiverseId\': 394232}, \'multiverseid\': 394232}, {\'name\': \'낡은 돌 하수인\', \'text\': \'당신이 이 턴에 다른 주문을 발동했을 때만 낡은 돌 하수인을 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 골렘\', \'flavor\': \'"그들의 기원은 아무도 모른다. 난 그들이 우리 세상이 잃어버린 비밀을 지키는 자들이라고 믿는다." —테무르의 속삭이는 자 질라야\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4ba42a7-107e-4252-9a03-905386b39b18\', \'multiverseId\': 394258}, \'multiverseid\': 394258}, {\'name\': \'Criados Entalhados em Pedra\', \'text\': \'Conjure Criados Entalhados em Pedra somente se tiver conjurado outra mágica neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'"A origem deles é coberta de mistérios. Eu acredito que eles sejam os protetores dos segredos perdidos do nosso mundo. — Jilaya, sussurrante Temur\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8426d14d-0976-4c1d-b1df-64af7f58e2b3\', \'multiverseId\': 394284}, \'multiverseid\': 394284}, {\'name\': \'Высеченные из Камня Служители\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывайте Высеченных из Камня Служителей, только если в этом ходу вы уже разыграли другое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'«Их происхождение окутано завесой тайны. Я думаю, что они — хранители забытых секретов нашего мира». — Джилайя, темурская шепчущая\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1974d4f4-4c5e-4d1a-be92-856d6295d0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 394310}, \'multiverseid\': 394310}, {\'name\': \'石雕侍从\', \'text\': \'只能于你已施放过其他咒语的回合中施放石雕侍从。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「它们的起源是未解之谜，我相信它们是我们世界失落之秘密的保护者。」 ～铁木尔低语者吉蕾娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60f3f6a-9e61-40dc-80c6-4ce31b8e1cb1\', \'multiverseId\': 394102}, \'multiverseid\': 394102}, {\'name\': \'石雕侍從\', \'text\': \'只能於你已施放過其他咒語的回合中施放石雕侍從。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'「它們的起源是未解之謎，我相信它們是我們世界失落之秘密的保護者。」 ～鐵木爾低語者吉蕾婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56464c1a-80a3-4f5f-bdb5-d035b407878c\', \'multiverseId\': 394128}, \'multiverseid\': 394128}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ugin der Geisterdrache\', \'text\': \'+2: Ugin der Geisterdrache fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n−X: Schicke alle ein- und mehrfarbigen bleibenden Karten mit umgewandelten Manakosten von X oder mehr ins Exil.\\n−10: Du erhältst 7 Lebenspunkte dazu, ziehst sieben Karten und bringst dann bis zu sieben bleibende Karten aus deiner Hand ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ugin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394164&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df675e88-e09d-4aad-91b3-c32c1500c44a\', \'multiverseId\': 394164}, \'multiverseid\': 394164}, {\'name\': \'Ugin, el dragón espíritu\', \'text\': \'+2: Ugin, el dragón espíritu hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.−X: Exilia cada permanente con coste de maná convertido de X o menos que sea de uno o más colores.−10: Gana 7 vidas, roba siete cartas y pon hasta siete cartas de permanentes de tu mano en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ugin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9077dfb2-727f-4333-a969-70f485537841\', \'multiverseId\': 394346}, \'multiverseid\': 394346}, {\'name\': \'Ugin, le dragon-esprit\', \'text\': "+2 : Ugin, le dragon-esprit inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.−X : Exilez chaque permanent avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à X qui a au moins une couleur.−10 : Vous gagnez 7 points de vie, piochez sept cartes, puis mettez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à sept cartes de permanent depuis votre main.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ugin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394190&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8353c0b-a401-4ce2-b58d-8fbfe4189fe9\', \'multiverseId\': 394190}, \'multiverseid\': 394190}, {\'name\': \'Ugin, lo Spirito Drago\', \'text\': \'+2: Ugin, lo Spirito Drago infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.−X: Esilia ogni permanente con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a X di uno o più colori.−10: Guadagni 7 punti vita, peschi sette carte, poi metti sul campo di battaglia fino a sette carte permanente dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ugin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2efd4c8f-3d34-4397-bec4-8e3571e02e3a\', \'multiverseId\': 394216}, \'multiverseid\': 394216}, {\'name\': \'精霊龍、ウギン\', \'text\': \'＋２：クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。精霊龍、ウギンはそれに３点のダメージを与える。－Ｘ：点数で見たマナ・コストがＸ以下の、１色以上の色を持つ各パーマネントをそれぞれ追放する。－10：あなたは７点のライフを得て、カードを７枚引く。その後、あなたの手札にある最大７枚までのパーマネント・カードを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — ウギン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efdf76c8-29e6-4be2-a83a-adf71d46ff2f\', \'multiverseId\': 394242}, \'multiverseid\': 394242}, {\'name\': \'신령 용 우진\', \'text\': \'+2: 생물이나 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 신령 용 우진은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.-X: 전환마나비용이 X 이하이고 한 가지 이상의 색을 가진 각 지속물을 추방한다.-10: 당신은 생명 7점을 얻고 카드 일곱 장을 뽑은 후, 당신의 손에서 지속물을 일곱 장까지 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 우진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663e0e44-0e28-4af5-a383-57d1d6b3e282\', \'multiverseId\': 394268}, \'multiverseid\': 394268}, {\'name\': \'Ugin, o Dragão Espírito\', \'text\': \'+2: Ugin, o Dragão Espírito, causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.−X: Exile cada permanente com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a X que seja colorida.−10: Você ganha 7 pontos de vida, compra sete cards e coloca até sete cards de permanente da sua mão no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ugin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef16f68-4644-41b6-9216-8e65f7b54da6\', \'multiverseId\': 394294}, \'multiverseid\': 394294}, {\'name\': \'Уджин, Дух Дракона\', \'text\': \'+2: Уджин, Дух Дракона наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.−X: изгоните каждый цветной перманент с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более X.−10: вы получаете 7 жизней, берете семь карт, затем кладете до семи карт перманентов из вашей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Уджин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d99db321-01bf-4d6e-9e19-7dd2f72f72b1\', \'multiverseId\': 394320}, \'multiverseid\': 394320}, {\'name\': \'灵龙乌金\', \'text\': \'+2：灵龙乌金对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。−X：放逐所有总法术力费用等于或小于X的有色永久物。−10：你获得7点生命，抓七张牌，然后将至多七张永久物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～乌金\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a595e9de-4300-4bff-b049-c15517f8780a\', \'multiverseId\': 394112}, \'multiverseid\': 394112}, {\'name\': \'靈龍烏金\', \'text\': \'+2：靈龍烏金對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。−X：放逐所有總魔法力費用等於或小於X的有色永久物。−10：你獲得7點生命，抽七張牌，然後將至多七張永久物牌從你手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～烏金\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9384d447-b22b-410e-866a-81ca5b0063b9\', \'multiverseId\': 394138}, \'multiverseid\': 394138}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ugins Konstrukt\', \'text\': \'Wenn Ugins Konstrukt ins Spiel kommt, opfere eine ein- oder mehrfarbige bleibende Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': \'Als er die Eldrazi auf Zendikar einsperrte, lernte Ugin nur wenig von Sorin, doch er gewann einen Einblick in die Grundprinzipien der Lithomagie von Nahiri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394165&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a3d89f2-43ae-4bc3-a7bc-fe36dd7e1b82\', \'multiverseId\': 394165}, \'multiverseid\': 394165}, {\'name\': \'Constructo de Ugin\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Constructo de Ugin entre al campo de batalla, sacrifica un permanente que sea de uno o más colores.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando encarcelaron a los Eldrazi en Zendikar, Ugin no aprendió mucho de Sorin, pero Nahiri sí que le enseñó los rudimentos de la litomancia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c0e6f6-8ed0-4734-91f3-7bae1bb7bd9c\', \'multiverseId\': 394347}, \'multiverseid\': 394347}, {\'name\': "Construction d\'Ugin", \'text\': "Quand la Construction d\'Ugin arrive sur le champ de bataille, sacrifiez un permanent qui a au moins une couleur.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': \'En emprisonnant les Eldrazi sur Zendikar, Ugin apprit peu de choses de Sorin, mais il glana les rudiments de la lithomancie auprès de Nahiri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ea63f76-a15f-472d-8ccf-f7fadc02732d\', \'multiverseId\': 394191}, \'multiverseid\': 394191}, {\'name\': \'Costrutto di Ugin\', \'text\': \'Quando il Costrutto di Ugin entra nel campo di battaglia, sacrifica un permanente di uno o più colori.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre era impegnato a intrappolare gli Eldrazi su Zendikar, Ugin non ottenne molto da Sorin, ma apprese i rudimenti della litomanzia da Nahiri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52b4f6b7-ae9e-4f2a-a022-7830df50e39d\', \'multiverseId\': 394217}, \'multiverseid\': 394217}, {\'name\': \'ウギンの構築物\', \'text\': \'ウギンの構築物が戦場に出たとき、１色以上の色を持つパーマネントを１つ生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': \'ゼンディカーにエルドラージを捕える間、ウギンはソリンからはほんの少ししか学べなかったが、ナヒリから石術の基礎を会得することができた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e07165-6d73-4c8e-a627-b520f2469ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 394243}, \'multiverseid\': 394243}, {\'name\': \'우진의 기계\', \'text\': \'우진의 기계가 전장에 들어올 때, 하나 이상의 색을 가진 지속물을 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 자동기계\', \'flavor\': \'우진이 젠디카르에 엘드라지를 가둘 때, 소린에게서 배운 것은 별로 없지만 나히리에게서는 보석술의 기본을 배웠다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c6f382-0ca1-44be-b0dd-3d22b51971d5\', \'multiverseId\': 394269}, \'multiverseid\': 394269}, {\'name\': \'Constructo de Ugin\', \'text\': \'Quando Constructo de Ugin entrar no campo de batalha, sacrifique uma permanente que seja colorida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto prendia os Eldrazi em Zendikar, Ugin aprendeu pouco com Sorin, mas vislumbrou os fundamentos da litomancia de Nahiri.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b86720-3cba-4609-8370-b3fb38226358\', \'multiverseId\': 394295}, \'multiverseid\': 394295}, {\'name\': \'Конструкция Уджина\', \'text\': \'Когда Конструкция Уджина выходит на поле битвы, пожертвуйте цветной перманент.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': \'Когда Уджин заключал Эльдрази в плен на Зендикаре, он ничего не узнал от Сорина, но научился основам литомантии, наблюдая за Нахири.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7778dfe1-2595-4f94-9d26-04ac475637ee\', \'multiverseId\': 394321}, \'multiverseid\': 394321}, {\'name\': \'乌金组构体\', \'text\': \'当乌金组构体进战场时，牺牲一个有色的永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～组构体\', \'flavor\': \'当初三人在赞迪卡携手禁锢奥札奇时，乌金并没能从索霖处学到什么，倒是从娜希丽那掌握了基础砾岩术\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74928d23-1007-4396-af76-90dab72602a0\', \'multiverseId\': 394113}, \'multiverseid\': 394113}, {\'name\': \'烏金組構體\', \'text\': \'當烏金組構體進戰場時，犧牲一個有色的永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～組構體\', \'flavor\': \'當初三人在贊迪卡攜手禁錮奧札奇時，烏金並沒能從索霖處學到什麼，倒是從娜希麗那掌握了基礎礫岩術。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208f8ee7-81be-428f-9c2e-0d87086c8384\', \'multiverseId\': 394139}, \'multiverseid\': 394139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unbarmherzige Schlitzerin\', \'text\': \'TodesberührungMorph—Zeige eine schwarze Karte auf deiner Hand offen vor. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)Wenn die Unbarmherzige Schlitzerin aufgedeckt wird, verliert ein Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394160&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8241d798-d96f-49eb-b913-4bd57bafb91f\', \'multiverseId\': 394160}, \'multiverseid\': 394160}, {\'name\': \'Desgarradora despiadada\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.Metamorfosis—Muestra una carta negra de tu mano. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)Cuando la Desgarradora despiadada se ponga boca arriba, el jugador objetivo pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'108278aa-8c46-4370-bcf2-ff819bdceec0\', \'multiverseId\': 394342}, \'multiverseid\': 394342}, {\'name\': \'Éventreuse impitoyable\', \'text\': "Contact mortelMue — Révélez une carte noire de votre main. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)Quand l\'Éventreuse impitoyable est retournée face visible, le joueur ciblé perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394186&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'016ad030-7ce1-4e93-87db-bc9d5aab684d\', \'multiverseId\': 394186}, \'multiverseid\': 394186}, {\'name\': \'Squartatrice Spietata\', \'text\': \'Tocco letaleMetamorfosi—Rivela una carta nera dalla tua mano. (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)Quando la Squartatrice Spietata viene girata a faccia in su, un giocatore bersaglio perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c83835e-6e23-4628-b6df-dabd920c4d64\', \'multiverseId\': 394212}, \'multiverseid\': 394212}, {\'name\': \'無情な切り裂き魔\', \'text\': \'接死変異 ― あなたの手札にある黒のカードを１枚公開する。（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）無情な切り裂き魔が表向きになったとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7a868d6-37af-4fec-9c12-1f4b216b2d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 394238}, \'multiverseid\': 394238}, {\'name\': \'무자비한 살인광\', \'text\': \'치명타변이—당신의 손에서 흑색 카드 한 장을 공개한다. (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)무자비한 살인광이 앞면으로 뒤집히면, 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 암살자\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2c9f4c0-9fd5-49db-8926-42e84c78bb32\', \'multiverseId\': 394264}, \'multiverseid\': 394264}, {\'name\': \'Estripadora Impiedosa\', \'text\': \'Toque mortíferoMetamorfose — Revele um card preto na sua mão. (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)Quando Estripadora Impiedosa é voltada para cima, o jogador alvo perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Assassino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b810aa7b-14a9-4432-9e5f-a7ea7700846b\', \'multiverseId\': 394290}, \'multiverseid\': 394290}, {\'name\': \'Безжалостная Потрошительница\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касаниеОборотень — Покажите черную карту, находящуюся в вашей руке. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)Когда Безжалостная Потрошительница переворачивается рубашкой вниз, целевой игрок теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Убийца\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c593a5-db92-4144-b222-2418439d28d2\', \'multiverseId\': 394316}, \'multiverseid\': 394316}, {\'name\': \'无情夺魂客\', \'text\': \'死触变身～从你手上展示一张黑色牌。（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）当无情夺魂客翻回正面时，目标牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a54eae-268b-4ab7-86c8-fbe3f81ac01e\', \'multiverseId\': 394108}, \'multiverseid\': 394108}, {\'name\': \'無情奪魂客\', \'text\': \'死觸變身～從你手上展示一張黑色牌。（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）當無情奪魂客翻回正面時，目標玩家失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／殺手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a130e9f-4cd0-43a4-8cdb-e043d4f111ce\', \'multiverseId\': 394134}, \'multiverseid\': 394134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildruf\', \'text\': \'Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek und lege dann X +1/+1-Marken auf sie. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Heulen des Windes verbirgt viele Gefahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394167&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b631ea9-3d7f-4e6a-a97c-ebf26d9e58e7\', \'multiverseId\': 394167}, \'multiverseid\': 394167}, {\'name\': \'Llamada salvaje\', \'text\': \'Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Un aullido en el viento esconde muchos peligros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaf081fe-1815-4cfb-9870-537fc4126f63\', \'multiverseId\': 394349}, \'multiverseid\': 394349}, {\'name\': \'Appel sauvage\', \'text\': "Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Un hurlement porté par le vent cache de nombreux dangers.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1c2234-1f45-4651-9db3-d21fa323a41f\', \'multiverseId\': 394193}, \'multiverseid\': 394193}, {\'name\': \'Richiamo Selvaggio\', \'text\': \'Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Un ululato nel vento cela molti pericoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a4d9acb-ab38-4b91-bc65-5dbe4ccf15da\', \'multiverseId\': 394219}, \'multiverseid\': 394219}, {\'name\': \'野生呼び\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示し、その後、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。（カードを予示するには、それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'風のうなる音は多くの危険を隠す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a5b9569-1663-4ed7-b9da-672f2d93d438\', \'multiverseId\': 394245}, \'multiverseid\': 394245}, {\'name\': \'야생의 부름\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한 다음, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 X 개를 올려놓는다. (카드를 구현화하려면 해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'바람을 타고 들리는 울부짖음은 많은 위험을 숨긴다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb943fdf-a8cc-4345-9c76-6b5bffb3f024\', \'multiverseId\': 394271}, \'multiverseid\': 394271}, {\'name\': \'Chamado Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório e coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nele. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um uivo no vento esconde muitos perigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24987155-d67e-4b7a-ad79-1682332ead05\', \'multiverseId\': 394297}, \'multiverseid\': 394297}, {\'name\': \'Дикий Зов\', \'text\': \'Воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки, затем положите на нее X жетонов +1/+1. (Чтобы воплотить карту, положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Вой, несущийся по ветру, сулит множество опасностей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb0a91f4-7c18-40f3-838b-6563bff2c58f\', \'multiverseId\': 394323}, \'multiverseid\': 394323}, {\'name\': \'荒野呼唤\', \'text\': \'显化你的牌库顶牌，然后在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物。（显化某张牌的流程是，将该牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'呼啸风声掩藏了许多危险。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a30753-ca46-439e-9279-dee8878d52a0\', \'multiverseId\': 394115}, \'multiverseid\': 394115}, {\'name\': \'荒野呼喚\', \'text\': \'顯化你的牌庫頂牌，然後在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物。（顯化某張牌的流程是，將該牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'呼嘯風聲掩藏了許多危險。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d75e7534-9b30-4244-8d6d-230f3e745455\', \'multiverseId\': 394141}, \'multiverseid\': 394141}]', "[{'name': 'Wächter des Spähnests', 'text': 'FliegendMorph—Zeige eine weiße Karte auf deiner Hand offen vor. (Du kannst diese Karte verdeckt für {3} als eine 2/2 Kreatur wirken. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Morph-Kosten auf.)Wenn der Wächter des Spähnests aufgedeckt wird, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vogel, Soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394166&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '781703be-6a79-429d-8def-3161003bce96', 'multiverseId': 394166}, 'multiverseid': 394166}, {'name': 'Vigilante del nido', 'text': 'Vuela.Metamorfosis—Muestra una carta blanca de tu mano. (Puedes lanzar esta carta boca abajo como una criatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento pagando su coste de metamorfosis.)Cuando el Vigilante del nido se ponga boca arriba, ganas 2 vidas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado ave', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394348&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e8463fe-d79c-4ed5-9f95-31c6bd567a04', 'multiverseId': 394348}, 'multiverseid': 394348}, {'name': 'Gardien du perchoir', 'text': 'VolMue — Révélez une carte blanche de votre main. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte face cachée comme une créature 2/2 pour {3}. Retournez-la à tout moment pour son coût de mue.)Quand le Gardien du perchoir est retourné face visible, vous gagnez 2 points de vie.', 'type': 'Créature : oiseau et soldat', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394192&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9335d9a2-4ebb-4b59-9b3c-2f6d2d4442f5', 'multiverseId': 394192}, 'multiverseid': 394192}, {'name': 'Guardiano del Trespolo', 'text': 'VolareMetamorfosi—Rivela una carta bianca dalla tua mano. (Puoi lanciare questa carta a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2 pagando {3}. Girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di metamorfosi.)Quando il Guardiano del Trespolo viene girato a faccia in su, guadagni 2 punti vita.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Uccello', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394218&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '547149ef-9a0c-45f4-b54e-714e1bfa5feb', 'multiverseId': 394218}, 'multiverseid': 394218}, {'name': '休息地の見張り', 'text': '飛行変異 ― あなたの手札にある白のカードを１枚公開する。（あなたはこのカードを、{3}で２/２クリーチャーとして裏向きに唱えてもよい。これの変異コストで、これをいつでも表向きにしてよい。）休息地の見張りが表向きになったとき、あなたは２点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 鳥・兵士', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394244&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4142cbf0-e44e-4d7d-8f3f-9eb0fa5707b7', 'multiverseId': 394244}, 'multiverseid': 394244}, {'name': '둥지 파수꾼', 'text': '비행변이—당신의 손에서 백색 카드 한 장을 공개한다. (당신은 {3}을 지불해서 이 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 발동할 수 있다. 언제든지 변이 비용을 지불하고 앞면이 보이도록 뒤집을 수 있다.)둥지 파수꾼이 앞면으로 뒤집히면, 당신은 생명 2점을 얻는다.', 'type': '생물 — 조류 병사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394270&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb0a7666-741b-4334-94a8-91b628edd2a8', 'multiverseId': 394270}, 'multiverseid': 394270}, {'name': 'Vigia do Poleiro', 'text': 'VoarMetamorfose — Revele um card branco na sua mão. (Você pode conjurar este card com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2 por {3}. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de metamorfose.)Quando Vigia do Poleiro é voltado para cima, você ganha 2 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Criatura — Ave Soldado', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394296&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1c7d3fa-b2e5-4720-97e1-b8c201d71d21', 'multiverseId': 394296}, 'multiverseid': 394296}, {'name': 'Дозорный Насеста', 'text': 'ПолетОборотень — Покажите белую карту, находящуюся в вашей руке. (Вы можете разыграть эту карту рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2 за {3}. Переверните ее рубашкой вниз в любой момент за ее стоимость Оборотня.)Когда Дозорный Насеста переворачивается рубашкой вниз, вы получаете 2 жизни.', 'type': 'Существо — Птица Солдат', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394322&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b1b16cb-9456-444a-9206-bc02522ca55b', 'multiverseId': 394322}, 'multiverseid': 394322}, {'name': '眺巢看守', 'text': '飞行变身～从你手上展示一张白色牌。（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌并支付{3}，将其当成2/2生物。可随时支付其变身费用使其翻回正面。）当眺巢看守翻回正面时，你获得2点生命。', 'type': '生物～鸟／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394114&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb8059fe-2ef1-4e59-8323-81b40e6bba17', 'multiverseId': 394114}, 'multiverseid': 394114}, {'name': '眺巢看守', 'text': '飛行變身～從你手上展示一張白色牌。（你可牌面朝下地施放此牌並支付{3}，將其當成2/2生物。可隨時支付其變身費用使其翻回正面。）當眺巢看守翻回正面時，你獲得2點生命。', 'type': '生物～鳥／士兵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394140&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef0c2f91-7eec-4fb9-a991-6ac9b8710b65', 'multiverseId': 394140}, 'multiverseid': 394140}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wütende Anrufung\', \'text\': \'Manifestiere die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek und lege dann zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie. (Um eine Karte zu manifestieren, bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zorn verleiht jenen Macht, die sich mit ihm verbünden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394150&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4780e694-6bac-48a5-8cba-44d117e2332c\', \'multiverseId\': 394150}, \'multiverseid\': 394150}, {\'name\': \'Invocación fiera\', \'text\': \'Manifiesta la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. (Para manifestar una carta, ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La ira puede hacer más fuertes a quienes la abrazan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f074257-23d4-4c99-b493-ef5701c1a18a\', \'multiverseId\': 394332}, \'multiverseid\': 394332}, {\'name\': \'Invocation violente\', \'text\': "Manifestez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. (Pour manifester une carte, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La colère peut offrir son pouvoir à ceux qui s\'y abandonnent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91adfde6-93ce-4bd8-b8de-ef8e4b82e5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 394176}, \'multiverseid\': 394176}, {\'name\': \'Invocazione Violenta\', \'text\': \'Manifesta la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. (Per manifestare una carta, mettila sul campo di battaglia a faccia in giù come una creatura 2/2. Se è una carta creatura, girala a faccia in su in qualsiasi momento pagando il suo costo di mana.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La rabbia può conferire forza a chi sceglie di abbracciarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd4dad8f-2600-4bf6-87ce-856bbadebffa\', \'multiverseId\': 394202}, \'multiverseid\': 394202}, {\'name\': \'激情の発動\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを予示し、その後、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。（カードを予示するには、それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードであるなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'怒りはそれを受け入れた者をより強くする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'776aed79-96c0-467a-b805-bc3fe07e52bf\', \'multiverseId\': 394228}, \'multiverseid\': 394228}, {\'name\': \'격렬한 부름\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 구현화한 다음, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. (카드를 구현화하려면 해당 카드를 뒷면 상태의 2/2 생물로 전장에 내려놓는다. 그 카드가 생물 카드라면 언제든 마나 비용을 지불하고 앞면 상태로 뒤집을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'분노를 받아들이는 이는 분노를 통해 힘을 얻는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dff2eb4e-f5f1-4f14-b90a-8c279f803d06\', \'multiverseId\': 394254}, \'multiverseid\': 394254}, {\'name\': \'Invocação Furiosa\', \'text\': \'Manifeste o card do topo do seu grimório e coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nele. (Para manifestar um card, coloque-o no campo de batalha com a face voltada para baixo como uma criatura 2/2. Volte sua face para cima a qualquer momento pagando seu custo de mana se for um card de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A ira pode dar forças aos que a aceitam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5cde82b-e786-418b-8fab-cdf7ed7c0f15\', \'multiverseId\': 394280}, \'multiverseid\': 394280}, {\'name\': \'Пылкое Заклятье\', \'text\': \'Воплотите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки, затем положите на нее два жетона +1/+1. (Чтобы воплотить карту, положите ее на поле битвы рубашкой вверх как существо 2/2. Если это карта существа, вы в любой момент можете перевернуть ее рубашкой вниз, оплатив ее мана-стоимость.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Злоба может придать сил тому, кто готов принять ее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1a3c81-feaf-4b6d-a9a1-8cf31d6ee09a\', \'multiverseId\': 394306}, \'multiverseid\': 394306}, {\'name\': \'狂热祝愿\', \'text\': \'显化你的牌库顶牌，然后在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物。（显化某张牌的流程是，将该牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'放纵怒火的人能感受其力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00f6405d-95f7-4cf5-b61c-565ec49885a5\', \'multiverseId\': 394098}, \'multiverseid\': 394098}, {\'name\': \'狂熱祝願\', \'text\': \'顯化你的牌庫頂牌，然後在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。（顯化某張牌的流程是，將該牌面朝下地放進戰場，當成2/2生物。如果該牌是生物牌，則可隨時支付其魔法力費用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'放縱怒火的人能感受其力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=394124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'477c3655-ff0e-444a-a76b-563883b87e18\', \'multiverseId\': 394124}, \'multiverseid\': 394124}]']
printings: ['A25', 'BFZ', 'BRB', 'C17', 'C18', 'C19', 'CLB', 'CMM', 'DDL', 'FRF', 'HOP', 'ISD', 'KTK', 'M21', 'MED', 'MKC', 'MOC', 'NEC', 'PAL02', 'PFRF', 'PKTK', 'PLST', 'PM21', 'PRM', 'SLP', 'UGIN', 'USG', 'WC00', 'WC99', 'WOC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["+2: Ugin, the Spirit Dragon deals 3 damage to target creature or player.\\n−X: Exile each permanent with converted mana cost X or less that's one or more colors.\\n−10: You gain 7 life, draw seven cards, then put up to seven permanent cards from your hand onto the battlefield.", 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target creatures and/or players.', "Briber's Purse enters the battlefield with X gem counters on it.\\n{1}, {T}, Remove a gem counter from Briber's Purse: Target creature can't attack or block this turn.", "Cast Hewed Stone Retainers only if you've cast another spell this turn.", 'Deathtouch\\nMorph—\\nReveal a black card in your hand. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Ruthless Ripper is turned face up, target player loses 2 life.', 'Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-2.', "Equipped creature gets +2/+2.\\nEquip {3}\\nGhostfire Blade's equip ability costs {2} less to activate if it targets a colorless creature.", "Exile target creature. Its controller manifests the top card of his or her library. (That player puts the top card of his or her library onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. If it's a creature card, it can be turned face up any time for its mana cost.)", 'First strike\\nMorph {4}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flying\\nMorph—\\nReveal a white card in your hand. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Watcher of the Roost is turned face up, you gain 2 life.', "Jeskai Infiltrator can't be blocked as long as you control no other creatures.\\nWhen Jeskai Infiltrator deals combat damage to a player, exile it and the top card of your library in a face-down pile, shuffle that pile, then manifest those cards. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Look at the top two cards of your library. Manifest one of those cards, then put the other on the top or bottom of your library. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Manifest the top card of your library, then put X +1/+1 counters on it. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Manifest the top card of your library, then put a +1/+1 counter on it. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Manifest the top card of your library, then put two +1/+1 counters on it. (To manifest a card, put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Manifest the top card of your library. (Put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Morph {2}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Jeering Instigator is turned face up, if it's your turn, gain control of another target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn.", 'Morph {B} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhenever another nontoken creature you control dies, draw a card.', "Mystic of the Hidden Way can't be blocked.\\nMorph {2}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)", 'Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature and untap it.', "When Sultai Emissary dies, manifest the top card of your library. (Put that card onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "When Ugin's Construct enters the battlefield, sacrifice a permanent that's one or more colors.", "Whenever Arashin War Beast deals combat damage to one or more blocking creatures, manifest the top card of your library. (Put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", "Whenever a permanent you control is turned face up, you gain 1 life for each creature you control.\\n{3}{W}: Manifest the top card of your library. (Put it onto the battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature. Turn it face up any time for its mana cost if it's a creature card.)", 'Whenever another permanent enters the battlefield under your control, each opponent puts the top card of his or her library into his or her graveyard.']
